<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Deepen me, rid me of the superficial;</l><l>From pale delusion set my spirit free;</l><l>All the entangled in me quick unravel;</l><l>Pluck forth each thread of insincerity.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thy vows are on me, oh to serve Thee truly</l><l>Love perfectly, in purity obey—</l><l>Burn, burn, O Fire, O Wind, now winnow throughly;</l><l>O Sword, awake against the flesh and slay.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
